title    Dusty Crate Loop
composer Claude
about    A 4-bar boom-bap loop in C minor. A chopped electric-piano sample over a heavy, sparse bass and a swung kit.
tempo    88
beats    4
steps    4
swing    0.18    # lazy 16th swing, the MPC feel boom-bap relies on

# Harmony: Cm9 | Abmaj9 | Fm9 | G7(#5b9), one chord per bar, i - VI - iv - V.
# Each new chord is pushed in early on the last eighth of the previous bar,
# like a chopped sample that is triggered a little ahead of the downbeat.

# keys: the "sample". Rootless four-note stacks in the C4 area, so the bass owns the roots.
# Voice leading is mostly by step, and the G7 voicing (B Eb F Ab) slides down a half step
# in every voice into the Cm9 voicing (Bb D Eb G) when the loop repeats.
# Rhythm per bar: a long hit, a softer re-hit on the "a" of beat 2, then the push.
voice keys epiano vol=0.9 pan=-0.15

# pad: a quiet string dyad sitting above the keys, like the background layer of a
# record sample. It moves with the keys' pushes so it never clashes with them, and drops
# out under the keys' little fill in bar 4.
voice pad strings vol=0.3 pan=0.25

# bass: heavy and sparse. Low roots held long, one hit on the kick at step 11,
# and a push into the next chord with the keys. Only 3 attacks per bar.
voice bass ebass vol=1.15

# drums: classic boom-bap kick (1, the "a" of 2, the "and" of 3, plus the push),
# hard backbeat snare with a couple of ghost notes, quiet swung 8th hats.
voice kick kick vol=1.1
voice snare snare vol=0.95
voice hat hat vol=0.5

pattern loop
keys  | Bb3+D4+Eb4+G4----- . Bb3+D4+Eb4+G4----? .- C4+Eb4+G4+Bb4- | ----- .- C4+Eb4+G4+Bb4----? .- Ab3+C4+Eb4+G4- | ----- .- Ab3+C4+Eb4+G4----? .- B3+Eb4+F4+Ab4- | ----- .- B3+Eb4+F4+Ab4--- . Ab4? . G4-? |
pad   | Bb4+D5------------- G4+C5- | -------------- Ab4+C5- | -------------- Ab4+B4- | ---------- .----- |
bass  | C2------! .-- G1-- . Ab1- | ------ .--- Eb2-- . F1- | ------ .--- C2-- . G1- | ------ .--- G2-- . D2-? |
kick  | X... ...x ..x. ..x. | X... ...x ..x. ..x. | X... ...x ..x. ..x. | X... ...x ..x. .... |
snare | .... X... .... X... | .... X..o .... X... | .... X... .... X... | .... X..o .... X.oo |
hat   | x.x. x.xo x.x. x.x. | x.x. x.x. x.xo x.x. | x.x. x.xo x.x. x.x. | x.x. x.x. x.xo x.o. |

loop loop
